# Left out of `ujust setup-backup` runs: things that are rebuilt on demand, are already backed up
# somewhere else, or are large enough to make a daily backup stop finishing. restic reads this as a
# list of patterns, one per line.
#
# To change it for your account, copy this file to ~/.config/amethystora/backup-excludes and edit
# that; the backup prefers yours when it exists.

# Caches, thumbnails and trash
**/.cache
**/Cache
**/CachedData
**/.thumbnails
**/.local/share/Trash

# Flatpak: the per-application caches, but not the application data next to them
**/.var/app/*/cache

# Container and virtual machine images, which are rebuilt from their definitions
**/.local/share/containers
**/.local/share/libvirt
**/.vagrant.d/boxes

# Dependency directories, restored by the tool that wrote them
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/target/debug
**/.gradle/caches
**/.cargo/registry
**/.rustup/toolchains
**/.npm/_cacache

# Build output and mounted remote filesystems
**/.steam
**/.local/share/Steam
**/.gvfs
